v class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"browse-by-topic-1\">Browse by topic</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"tile-grid\"><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/safety/\"><div class=\"ico\">🛡️</div><h3>Safety</h3><div class=\"count\">2 guides</div></a><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/guides/\"><div class=\"ico\">🧭</div><h3>Guides</h3><div class=\"count\">3 guides</div></a><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/privacy/\"><div class=\"ico\">🔒</div><h3>Privacy</h3><div class=\"count\">2 guides</div></a><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/ai/\"><div class=\"ico\">🤖</div><h3>AI</h3><div class=\"count\">1 guide</div></a><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/vr/\"><div class=\"ico\">🥽</div><h3>VR</h3><div class=\"count\">1 guide</div></a><a class=\"tile\" href=\"/blog/topic/creators/\"><div class=\"ico\">⭐</div><h3>Creators</h3><div class=\"count\">1 guide</div></a></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 id=\"all-guides-2\">All guides</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"post-list\"><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/safety/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Safety</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/how-to-tell-a-real-adult-site-from-a-malware-trap/\">How to tell a real adult site from a malware trap</a></h3>\n      <p>The five signals that separate a legitimate platform from a page that just wants your browser.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/how-to-tell-a-real-adult-site-from-a-malware-trap/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/guides/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Guides</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/free-versus-premium-what-you-are-actually-paying-for/\">Free versus premium: what you are actually paying for</a></h3>\n      <p>The real trade is not price against no-price. It is your attention against your money.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/free-versus-premium-what-you-are-actually-paying-for/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/safety/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Safety</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/why-free-onlyfans-links-are-almost-always-a-scam/\">Why &#x27;free OnlyFans&#x27; links are almost always a scam</a></h3>\n      <p>The search term is popular. The destinations behind it are a minefield of malware, fraud and stolen content.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/why-free-onlyfans-links-are-almost-always-a-scam/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/privacy/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Privacy</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/a-vpn-for-adult-sites-what-it-does-and-what-it-doesn-t/\">A VPN for adult sites: what it does, and what it doesn&#x27;t</a></h3>\n      <p>A VPN is a privacy tool, not an invisibility cloak. Knowing the difference matters.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/a-vpn-for-adult-sites-what-it-does-and-what-it-doesn-t/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/guides/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Guides</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/reading-cam-site-pricing-before-it-reads-your-wallet/\">Reading cam site pricing before it reads your wallet</a></h3>\n      <p>Tokens, tips and private shows are designed to obscure the real cost. Here is how to see through it.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/reading-cam-site-pricing-before-it-reads-your-wallet/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/ai/\" style=\"color:inherit\">AI</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/ai-adult-tools-and-your-data-check-this-before-you-upload/\">AI adult tools and your data: check this before you upload</a></h3>\n      <p>Generators and companions are only as safe as their data policy. Most people never read it.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/ai-adult-tools-and-your-data-check-this-before-you-upload/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/guides/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Guides</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/spotting-fake-reviews-and-invented-ratings-in-directories/\">Spotting fake reviews and invented ratings in directories</a></h3>\n      <p>Most directories score every site 9-point-something. Here is how to tell a real assessment from a formula.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/spotting-fake-reviews-and-invented-ratings-in-directories/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/vr/\" style=\"color:inherit\">VR</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/vr-adult-content-headset-compatibility-explained-plainly/\">VR adult content: headset compatibility, explained plainly</a></h3>\n      <p>The format is genuinely different. The compatibility claims are genuinely unreliable. Read this first.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/vr-adult-content-headset-compatibility-explained-plainly/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/creators/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Creators</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/support-creators-directly-and-why-leak-sites-cost-more-than-they-seem/\">Support creators directly, and why leak sites cost more than they seem</a></h3>\n      <p>The free version of paid content has a price. It is just paid by someone else.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/support-creators-directly-and-why-leak-sites-cost-more-than-they-seem/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article><article class=\"post-card\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\"><a href=\"/blog/topic/privacy/\" style=\"color:inherit\">Privacy</a></div>\n      <h3><a href=\"/blog/browser-hygiene-for-private-adult-browsing/\">Browser hygiene for private adult browsing</a></h3>\n      <p>A handful of settings does more for your privacy than any single tool you can buy.</p>\n      <a class=\"more\" href=\"/blog/browser-hygiene-for-private-adult-browsing/\">Read guide →</a>\n    </article></div>\n  </section>\n</article></main>\n<footer class=\"site-foot de-foot\">\n  <div class=\"de-foot-band\"><div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"de-foot-top\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"/assets/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"><span class=\"wordmark\"><b>Dark</b><span class=\"ero\">-Ero</span></span></a>\n      <p>An independent adult-site directory. Listings go straight to the site. Scores appear only after a real review.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"de-foot-icons\">\n      <a href=\"/contact/\" aria-label=\"Contact\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m3 7 9 6 9-6\"/></svg><span>Contact</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/blog/\" aria-label=\"Blog\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20\"/><path d=\"M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z\"/></svg><span>Blog</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/categories/\" aria-label=\"All categories\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/></svg><span>Categories</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/category/sell-feet-pics/\" aria-label=\"Feet marketplaces\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 16c2-6 4-9 8-9s6 3 8 9\"/><path d=\"M